	<section class="widget widgetNewsFlash skin59 widgetOptionSet28 wide" data-modulewidgettype="newsFlash" id="widgetNewsFlasha2ac7886-bf43-44b5-8fa4-75862126e247" data-elementqueryclasses='{"wide-narrow":"min-width:25em"}' data-elementquerymatch='matchMultiColumn' data-elementqueryunmatch='unmatchMultiColumn' aria-label="News Flash">
			<div class="widgetBody cpGrid cpGrid1 ">




<div class="cpCarousel cpCarousela2ac7886-bf43-44b5-8fa4-75862126e247">
	<div class="cpWindow cpWindowa2ac7886-bf43-44b5-8fa4-75862126e247">
		<ol class="semanticList cpSlider">
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="0">
								<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/11057/2026-TAX-ABATEMENT-GUIDELINES--CRITERIA-WEBB-COUNTY" target="_blank"><img class="media cover" src="/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=11058" alt="Tax Abatement graphic" data-delayed-image="" style="height: 275px"/></a>
						<div class="text">
							<h2 id="newsFlashItemHeader27" class="widgetTitle">		<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/11057/2026-TAX-ABATEMENT-GUIDELINES--CRITERIA-WEBB-COUNTY" target="_blank">Proposed 2026 Tax Abatement Guidelines and Criteria </a>
</h2>	<div class="widgetDesc">
Proposed Webb County
Tax Abatement Guidelines and Criteria
Adopted July 27, 2026						<a id="newsFlashReadOn27" href="/DocumentCenter/View/11057/2026-TAX-ABATEMENT-GUIDELINES--CRITERIA-WEBB-COUNTY" target="_blank" class="readOn" aria-label="Read on...: Proposed 2026 Tax Abatement Guidelines and Criteria">Read on...</a>
	</div>

						</div>
						</li>
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="1">
								<a href="https://scofflaw.go2gov.net/webb" target="_blank"><img class="media cover" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-delay-load="/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=10787" alt="Scofflaw of Texas " data-delayed-image="" style="height: 275px"/></a>
						<div class="text">
							<h2 id="newsFlashItemHeader14" class="widgetTitle">		<a href="https://scofflaw.go2gov.net/webb" target="_blank">Scofflaw </a>
</h2>	<div class="widgetDesc">
Starting June 1, 2026, unpaid fines or fees in Webb County may prevent you from renewing your vehicle registration.						<a id="newsFlashReadOn14" href="https://scofflaw.go2gov.net/webb" target="_blank" class="readOn" aria-label="Are you on the list? ...: Scofflaw">Are you on the list? ...</a>
	</div>

						</div>
						</li>
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="2">
								<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/10777/2025-2026-Public-Notice_FINAL?bidId=" target="_blank"><img class="media cover" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-delay-load="/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=10791" alt="Budget Adoption Public Hearing" data-delayed-image="" style="height: 275px"/></a>
						<div class="text">
							<h2 id="newsFlashItemHeader16" class="widgetTitle">		<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/10777/2025-2026-Public-Notice_FINAL?bidId=" target="_blank">Public Notice: Budget Adoption Public Hearing </a>
</h2>	<div class="widgetDesc">
Pursuant to Texas Local Government Code, Section 111.067, the Webb County Commissioners Court will hold a public hearing to adopt the Webb County budget.						<a id="newsFlashReadOn16" href="/DocumentCenter/View/10777/2025-2026-Public-Notice_FINAL?bidId=" target="_blank" class="readOn" aria-label="View Public Notice: Public Notice: Budget Adoption Public Hearing">View Public Notice</a>
	</div>

						</div>
						</li>
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="3">
								<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/10778/Elected-officials-salary-ad-25-26?bidId=" target="_blank"><img class="media cover" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-delay-load="/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=10792" alt="Proposed Salaries and Allowances for Webb County Elected Officials" data-delayed-image="" style="height: 275px"/></a>
						<div class="text">
							<h2 id="newsFlashItemHeader17" class="widgetTitle">		<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/10778/Elected-officials-salary-ad-25-26?bidId=" target="_blank">Proposed Salaries & Allowances for Webb County Elected Officials </a>
</h2>	<div class="widgetDesc">
The schedule of proposed salaries and allowances for Elected Officials.						<a id="newsFlashReadOn17" href="/DocumentCenter/View/10778/Elected-officials-salary-ad-25-26?bidId=" target="_blank" class="readOn" aria-label="Download: Proposed Salaries &amp; Allowances for Webb County Elected Officials">Download</a>
	</div>

						</div>
						</li>
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="4">
								<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/10779/TX-PACE---Webb-County-Report-with-Exhibits?bidId=" target="_blank"><img class="media cover" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-delay-load="/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=10793" alt="Proposed Property Assessed Clean Energy (PACE) Program " data-delayed-image="" style="height: 275px"/></a>
						<div class="text">
							<h2 id="newsFlashItemHeader18" class="widgetTitle">		<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/10779/TX-PACE---Webb-County-Report-with-Exhibits?bidId=" target="_blank">Proposed Property Assessed Clean Energy (PACE) Program </a>
</h2>	<div class="widgetDesc">
This Report is adopted by the County Commissioners Court for Webb County, Texas PACE program in accordance with the requirements of the "PACE Act" as set forth in Texas Local Government Code Chapter 399.						<a id="newsFlashReadOn18" href="/DocumentCenter/View/10779/TX-PACE---Webb-County-Report-with-Exhibits?bidId=" target="_blank" class="readOn" aria-label="Click here for more info ...: Proposed Property Assessed Clean Energy (PACE) Program">Click here for more info ...</a>
	</div>

						</div>
						</li>
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="5">
								<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/11056/2026-WEBB-COUNTY-TNT" target="_blank"><img class="media cover" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" data-delay-load="/ImageRepository/Document?documentID=10794" alt="Webb County Truth and Taxation Calculation Worksheet" data-delayed-image="" style="height: 275px"/></a>
						<div class="text">
							<h2 id="newsFlashItemHeader19" class="widgetTitle">		<a href="/DocumentCenter/View/11056/2026-WEBB-COUNTY-TNT" target="_blank">2026 Webb County Truth & Taxation Calculation Worksheet </a>
</h2>	<div class="widgetDesc">
Tax Code Section 26.04(c) requires an officer or employee designated by the governing body to calculate the no-new-revenue (NNR) tax rate and voter-approval tax rate for the taxing unit.						<a id="newsFlashReadOn19" href="/DocumentCenter/View/11056/2026-WEBB-COUNTY-TNT" target="_blank" class="readOn" aria-label="Download the worksheet ...: 2026 Webb County Truth &amp; Taxation Calculation Worksheet">Download the worksheet ...</a>
	</div>

						</div>
						</li>
						<li class="widgetItem" data-index="6">
